  "manifest_sha256": "7294e3edcd3468aeb8881182f77a3f22c9d9de41dff1dba8f183e9fe1753c9a7",
  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the retail price of one pack of glue sticks at the school-supply store? Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 28 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The number of students, 28, does not give any information about the price of a pack of glue sticks. Therefore, the retail price cannot be determined from the information provided.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "GOOD: —\nBAD: —\nWATCH: \"Solve this problem step by step. Put you\"",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 27 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "1. The class size is 27 students.\n2. However, no information is given about the price of a pack of glue sticks.\n3. Therefore, the retail price cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: the glue sticks come in packs of 9.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "1. There are 27 students.\n2. Each pack contains 9 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 9 = 3\n\\]\n\nSo, the class would need 3 packs. However, the price per pack is not provided.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. The glue sticks come in packs of 8.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "1. The class has 27 students.\n2. Each pack contains 8 glue sticks.\n3. To provide one glue stick per student:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 8 = 3\\text{ remainder }3\n\\]\n\nSo, 4 packs would be needed. However, the price of one pack is not provided.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: the school-supply store sells each pack of glue sticks for $6.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "1. The store sells each pack of glue sticks for \\$6.\n2. The question asks for the retail price of **one pack**, which is already given.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: the store does not offer discounts on glue-stick packs.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The store charges \\$6 per pack, and there are no discounts.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: How many packs of glue sticks does Mr. Jackson need to buy so every student can have 2 glue sticks? By the way, here are some relevant details: Mr. Jackson wants to give each student 2 glue sticks. Mr. Jackson can only buy whole packs and expects to have some extra glue sticks left over.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "1. Mr. Jackson needs \\(2\\) glue sticks for each of \\(27\\) students:\n\n\\[\n27 \\times 2 = 54 \\text{ glue sticks}\n\\]\n\n2. Each pack contains \\(8\\) glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n54 \\div 8 = 6.75\n\\]\n\nSince he can only buy whole packs, he must buy \\(7\\) packs.\n\n3. Seven packs contain:\n\n\\[\n7 \\times 8 = 56 \\text{ glue sticks}\n\\]\n\nThis leaves \\(56-54=2\\) extra glue sticks.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{7\\text{ packs}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
